  "steps": [
    "Mix the chicken with olive oil, garlic, cumin, paprika, ground coriander, cinnamon, turmeric, black pepper, salt, and half the lemon juice. Let it sit while you prepare the vegetables.",
    "Stir the Greek yoghurt with the remaining lemon juice and half the chopped mint. Taste and season with a little salt if needed.",
    "Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat and cook the chicken for 6 to 8 minutes, turning occasionally, until browned outside and cooked through.",
    "Remove the chicken from the pan and rest for 2 minutes, then slice into strips.",
    "Warm the tortillas in a dry pan for a few seconds on each side until pliable.",
    "Fill each tortilla with chicken, red onion, cucumber, and tomato. Spoon over the yoghurt sauce and finish with the remaining mint and parsley.",
    "Roll up the wraps tightly and serve immediately."
  ],
